\par\par \b \uc2 Alphabet\uc2  Shares Fall Premarket After Report on Further AI Talent Departures -- Update\b0\par\par\uc2 By Joe Stonor \par \uc2 293 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2026\par 14:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 Alphabet\uc2  shares fell further premarket following a report that two researchers key to \uc2 Google\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial-intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  model left the group, extending an exodus in top talent from the search company's AI team.\par \par \uc2 Shares in the \uc2 Google\uc2  owner slid 1.3% to $340.82 in premarket trade even as the broader tech complex rallied. The fall deepens a selloff prompted by the departure of AI architects last week, with shares set to open 7.4% lower than their close Thursday before the Juneteenth holiday.\par \par \uc2 Jonas Adler and Alexander Pritzel are planning to leave \uc2 Google\uc2  for \uc2 Anthropic\uc2 , \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  reported, citing unnamed sources. The pair are leading researchers behind \uc2 Google\uc2 's Gemini model, which is a rival to \uc2 Anthropic\uc2 's Claude range.\par \par \uc2 Alphabet\uc2  stock fell 5% Monday--its biggest one-day decline in over a year--after AI heavyweights John Jumper and Noam Shazeer said they were leaving the company for \uc2 Anthropic\uc2  and \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 , respectively.\par \par \uc2 Adler and Pritzel weren't immediately available for comment. \uc2 Google\uc2  and \uc2 Anthropic\uc2  didn't reply to a request for comment.\par \par \uc2 Speaking at a Cannes event earlier this week, Demis Hassabis, chief executive of \uc2 Google\uc2 's AI lab DeepMind, said that \uc2 Google\uc2  was holding its own amid fierce competition for talent among AI labs.\par \par \uc2 "We have by far the biggest and broadest research bench of any of the labs out there," Hassabis said.\par \par \uc2 Several junior researchers and engineers have also left \uc2 Google\uc2  in recent days.\par \par \uc2 News Corp\uc2 , owner of The Wall Street Journal, has a commercial agreement to supply content on \uc2 Google\uc2  platforms.\par \par \uc2 Write to Joe Stonor at josephmichael.stonor@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 25, 2026 08:50 ET (12:50 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260625em6p001yk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
