his cautionary statement.\par \par \uc2 DeepHealth Media Contact\par \par \uc2 Andra Axente\par \par \uc2 Director of Communications\par \par \uc2 +31614440971\par \par \uc2 andra.axente@deephealth.com\par \par \uc2 RadNet Media Contacts\par \par \uc2 Jane Mazur\par \par \uc2 Senior Vice President, Corporate Communications\par \par \uc2 +1 585-355-5978\par \par \uc2 jane.mazur@radnet.com\par \par \uc2 Mark Stolper\par \par \uc2 Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer\par \par \uc2 +1 310-445-2800\par \par \uc2 25 Jun 2026 06:00 ET  Press Release: DeepHealth Receives Two FDA -2-\par \par \uc2 References \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    1. Breast Suite comprises multiple applications, including Mammo Dx, Breast \par       Density, Safeguard Review, Risk Assessment, BAC Assessment, DeepHealth \par       Viewer, Mammography Insights and Breast Ultrasound. DeepHealth Viewer is \par       manufactured by eRAD, Inc. and distributed by DeepHealth, Inc. \par       Mammography Insights is manufactured by Aquila, Inc. and distributed by \par       DeepHealth, Inc. Any claims made about Breast Suite may reference claims \par       associated with its individual components. \par  \par    2. Nandurkar et al., "Breast Arterial Calcification as a Predictor for \par       Future Cardiovascular Events and Mortality: A Systematic Review and \par       Meta-analysis," Journal of Breast Imaging, 2026. \par  \par    3. The FDA-cleared software previously known as ProFound Pro is now marketed \par       as Mammo Dx including priors. Mammo Dx retains the FDA-cleared \par       capabilities of ProFound Pro and serves as the foundation for ongoing \par       innovation, with additional features and enhancements being introduced \par       over time. \par  \par    4. FDA 510(k) clearance K254131. Clinical Performance Testing. \par  \par    5. Not cleared for use in the U.S. Capability available in Europe. \par  \par    6. Louis, L. et al. "Equitable Impact of an AI-Driven Breast Cancer \par       Screening Workflow in Real World US-wide Deployment." Nature Health, \par       2025. \par  \par    7. McCabe et al. "Multistage AI-Driven Workflow Improves General Radiologist \par       Screening Mammography Performance to the Level of Fellowship-Trained \par       Breast Imagers: Real-world Evidence in >500,000 Patients." RSNA Chicago. \par       2025. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 25 Jun 2026 06:01 ET *DeepHealth Receives Two FDA Clearances Enabling It to Add Cardiovascular Insights and Prior Exam Integration to Its AI-Powered Breast Suite >RDNT\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (MORE TO FOLLOW) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 June 25, 2026 06:01 ET (10:01 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260625em6p00121\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
