\par\par \b \uc2 Dow Jones Top Company Headlines at 7 AM ET: Germany's Merck to Buy \uc2 Bio-Techne\uc2  for $11 Billion | \uc2 Anthropic\uc2  ...\b0\par\par\uc2 494 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2026\par 13:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 Germany's Merck to Buy \uc2 Bio-Techne\uc2  for $11 Billion\par \par \uc2 Merck KGaA\uc2  offered $73 a share in cash for \uc2 Bio-Techne\uc2 , representing a 24% premium to the U.S. lab-tools supplier's closing price Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Anthropic\uc2  Claims Alibaba Ran 'Brazen' Campaign to Access Its \uc2 Claude AI\uc2  Model\par \par \uc2 U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial-intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  lab \uc2 Anthropic\uc2  has accused Chinese e-commerce giant \uc2 Alibaba\uc2  of "illicitly" accessing its frontier model Claude to harvest its capabilities.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Volkswagen\uc2  to Sell Majority Stake in Everllence For $8.4 Billion\par \par \uc2 The sale of the 51% stake in the marine engine subsidiary to \uc2 Bain Capital\uc2  will streamline the automaker's investment portfolio and boost its coffers.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2  to Invest Additional $13 Billion in India by 2030\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2 's planned spending to expand and support AI and cloud infrastructure in India builds on the $35 billion investment that was outlined last year.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 H&M\uc2  Hit by One-Off Costs as Turnaround Efforts Continue\par \par \uc2 Earnings were dented by $127.2 million in restructuring costs as the retailer made organizational changes.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Lockheed Martin\uc2  Lands $35 Billion Missile-Defense Deal\par \par \uc2 The Pentagon's order of Thaad interceptors follows the company's pledge to expand production over seven years.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Pizza Has Gone Cold. Domino's Is Still Worth a Look.\par \par \uc2 The category's sales are stagnant and its chains are faltering, but Domino's can emerge as a winner\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 easyJet\uc2  to Open Books to Castlelake After Rejecting Revised $6.49 Billion Bid\par \par \uc2 The move marks a shift in \uc2 easyJet\uc2 's stance toward \uc2 Castlelake\uc2 , which as recently as Monday called out the airline's unwillingness to engage meaningfully.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2 , \uc2 Microsoft\uc2 's Cloud Services Should Fall Under DMA, EU Says\par \par \uc2 Under the Digital Markets Act, the companies would be treated as gatekeepers for their cloud computing services and required to take extra steps to ensure they don't stifle competition.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Micron Shares Jump as Chip Shortage Projected to Last Beyond 2027\par \par \uc2 Revenue and profit for the chip maker soared on robust memory demand.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 LVMH\uc2  Fires Back at Herm\u232\'00\'E8s Heir Over His Missing Fortune\par \par \uc2 The luxury group says it was unaware of any misappropriation of Herm\u232\'00\'E8s shares when it was building up a covert position in its rival.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Lots of Companies Are Doin' the CEO Shuffle. Wall Street Doesn't Always Like the Moves.\par \par \uc2 Domino's Pizza\uc2  shares fell after it named a new CEO. It wasn't an unusual reaction on Wall Street.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Big Banks Ace an Easier Annual Stress Test\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan and Bank of America passed the tests with flying colors after the Federal Reserve last year began releasing details of the tests in advance.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Rocket Lab\uc2 , \uc2 Lockheed Martin\uc2  among the partners in \uc2 SpaceX\uc2 's military space-laser project\par \par \uc2 Government documents show a lineup of defense contractors joining \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  to create a satellite network to track airborne threats.\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 25, 2026 07:00 ET (11:00 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260625em6p00188\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
